<p>Gets the object ID of the Nth player map patch
</p>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> GetPlayerMapPatch(<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Object%20keyword" title="Object keyword">object</a> pPlayer,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/String%20keyword" title="String keyword">string</a> sTag,<br />    <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Int%20keyword" title="Int keyword">int</a> nNth&#160;= 0<br />);</div>
<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">pPlayer<dd>Object ID of player<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">sTag<dd>Tag string to search for<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nNth<dd>Integer ordinal of object
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
