<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Each player has a list of map patches and states for each area. This function looks up the Nth object ID of a map patch tag for a particular player. Note that the patch could be from any of the currently loaded areas.
</p><p><br />
</p>
